Title: CCIcompass: Composite Interaction Score for Cell-Cell Interaction Prioritization
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Prioritizes and ranks cell-cell interactions (CCIs) from
    single-cell RNA-seq data using the Composite Interaction Score (CIS),
    an ensemble metric based on Rank-Biased Precision (RBP) that aggregates
    results across six CCI inference methods implemented in the LIANA framework.
URL: https://github.com/olhakholod/CCIcompass
BugReports: https://github.com/olhakholod/CCIcompass/issues

